    {
      "text": "每次出海七天后利维坦都会吞噬玩家，但十亿美元宇宙债务会让其死而复生并跨局变强。",
      "dimension": "故事",
      "excerpt": "The Leviathan, a cosmic force of death, will try to consume you after seven days on the water. At first, you won't be able to stop it; you're a mere mortal, and it's an infinite eldritch being. However, you have an advantage: a billion-dollar cosmic debt which returns you from the dead. With each new run, you grow stronger.",
