      "label": "证据原文片段"
    },
    {
      "text": "把钓上来的鱼当敌人击败再出售，还能把鱼招进骷髅军团参与战斗。",
      "dimension": "玩法",
      "excerpt": "FISH FEAR ME is a top-down Vampire Survivors -style roguelite where you fish up your enemies to fight, defeat, and sell them!",
